#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Welcome to the CentreStack Android Client User Guide. This guide "
"describes the Android client application for CentreStack, the managed "
"file synchronization, and sharing solution."
msgstr "欢迎阅读CentreStack Android客户端用户指南。本指南介绍了CentreStack的Android客户端应用程序，这是一个管理文件同步和共享的解决方案。"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Users can access his cloud files using any device of their choice as "
"CentreStack has clients for Windows, Mac, iPhone, iPad, Android, and "
"more. User can download from the Google Play Store this a native Android "
"application. That provides access to files and folders in user's "
"CentreStack account."
msgstr "用户可以使用他们选择的任何设备访问其云文件，因为CentreStack拥有Windows、Mac、iPhone、iPad、Android等客户端。用户可以从Google Play商店下载这个原生Android应用程序。该应用程序提供对用户CentreStack账户中的文件和文件夹的访问。"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"The white-labeled CentreStack Android app called \"Cloud Android Client\""
" by Gladinet can be distributed by service providers and enterprises to "
"their users."
msgstr "Gladinet 推出的白标 CentreStack Android 应用程序名为“Cloud Android Client”，可以由服务提供商和企业分发给他们的用户。"

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid ""
"User can obtain a fully branded CentreStack Android Client with company "
"name and product logo from the Partner Portal "
"https://www.centrestack.com. The look and feel of the app may be "
"different but the functionality is the same."
msgstr "用户可以从合作伙伴门户网站https://www.centrestack.com 获取一个完全品牌化的CentreStack Android客户端，包含公司名称和产品logo。应用的外观可能有所不同，但功能是相同的。"

